Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软在GitHub开源iOS渲染库SwiftStreamingMarkdown，优化AI流式文本显示</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI斥资1.5亿美元启动合作伙伴网络，计划2026年底认证30万名专业顾问</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google发布Gemini-SQL2模型，Text-to-SQL执行准确率达80.04%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌云发布开放知识格式 OKF，为 AI 代理构建标准化知识底座</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6908788111d144011217c172eefd50c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌云正式推出开放知识格式（Open Knowledge Format，简称 OKF），旨在通过标准化手段解决企业非结构化数据碎片化问题，为 AI 代理构建高效知识输入体系。OKF v0.1 版本将 PDF、Office 等复杂文档统一转化为带有 YAML 元数据的 Markdown 格式，确立了“LLM-Wiki”开放标准。该格式强调厂商中立性与互操作性，开发者无需依赖专有平台或 SDK，即可将企业知识解构为易于检索的“知识原子”，并通过 Markdown 链接构建语义关联图谱。作为对 RAG 架构的底层优化，OKF 旨在降低企业构建私有化 AI 引擎的门槛，提升 AI 代理的语义理解精度与响应质量。在 AI 代理化趋势下，此举通过标准化数据表征，为跨模型、跨代理的知识流动与企业级 AI 规模化协作奠定了技术</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱正式官宣GLM-5.2模型全量开源，支持1M上下文长程处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2005366d3b30a5a217976b7a1e0f1295.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱于6月13日正式宣布旗下最强开源模型GLM-5.2实现全量开放，旨在推动前沿智能技术的普及。该模型在性能上实现突破，具备真正可用的1M上下文长程处理能力，并在长序列任务逻辑理解及编程辅助领域表现优异，被视为国产AI代码生成的重要标杆。目前，GLM-5.2已面向GLM Coding Plan全量版本用户开启抢先体验。官方确认，该模型的API接口及完整开源代码将于下周正式上线，并采用MIT协议，以降低开发者的技术接入门槛。此次开源是智谱应对全球AI技术垄断趋势的重要举措，通过坚定开源策略，为开发者提供更具包容性的技术底座，助力国产AI生态摆脱对单一闭源体系的依赖，加速推动全民创新。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在GitHub开源iOS渲染库SwiftStreamingMarkdown，优化AI流式文本显示</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软近日在GitHub开源了专为iOS平台设计的渲染库SwiftStreamingMarkdown，旨在解决大模型应用在移动端进行Markdown文本流式渲染时的性能瓶颈。该库采用MIT许可证，支持通过Swift Package Manager集成，对应用包体积影响仅约3MB。核心优势在于针对流式传输深度优化，支持随文本增量返回同步解析与渲染，即使在iPhone XS等老旧机型上也能保持主线程低占用，有效规避UI卡顿。功能上，该库兼容CommonMark与GitHub风格Markdown（GFM）核心语法，包括标题、代码块、表格及LaTeX公式，并提供主题定制与交互追踪钩子。微软同步提供了SwiftUI示例工程，开发者可通过StreamedMarkdownView组件快速实现丝滑的AI聊天界面渲染，显著降低了i</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI斥资1.5亿美元启动合作伙伴网络，计划2026年底认证30万名专业顾问</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式推出“OpenAI合作伙伴网络”计划，并投入1.5亿美元专项资金，旨在通过构建全球生态系统，加速企业AI转型落地。该计划引入分级激励机制，合作伙伴可根据业绩与技术实力晋升为精选、高级或精英级别，未来将涵盖Codex、网络安全及智能体等专业认证。OpenAI设定了明确目标，计划在2026年底前培养并认证30万名专业顾问。此外，官方启动“前沿部署专家”试点项目，使顶尖技术人员能与OpenAI工程团队深度对接。目前，埃森哲、贝恩咨询、波士顿咨询、麦肯锡及普华永道等全球领军机构已首批加入。OpenAI表示，企业AI转型的核心挑战已从模型能力转向场景识别与业务流程重塑，通过生态化合作，旨在将AI技术转化为实际业务成果，实现AI红利的普惠化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google发布Gemini-SQL2模型，Text-to-SQL执行准确率达80.04%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google Research于6月12日正式发布基于Gemini 3.1 Pro打造的专用模型Gemini-SQL2，旨在优化AI处理“文本转SQL”（Text-to-SQL）任务的能力。在权威基准测试平台BIRD的单模型赛道中，Gemini-SQL2以80.04%的执行准确率刷新行业标杆。该评测集涵盖37个专业领域的95个数据库及1.2万组问题，包含脏数据与外部知识辅助等复杂场景。Gemini-SQL2通过自然语言交互降低了数据库查询门槛，使非技术人员能通过对话获取精准分析报告，显著提升企业数据自助分析效率。目前，谷歌尚未披露该模型的具体API接口、模型标识及详细技术报告，也未公布首批集成该能力的产品线。业内关注重点在于其后续如何重塑企业级数据分析作业流程。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
